1
00:02:25,159 --> 00:02:26,639
Today's secret

2
00:02:26,879 --> 00:02:28,240
is strictly between us.

3
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,199
You know it,

4
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,439
and I know it.

5
00:02:43,199 --> 00:02:45,319
I think I forgot to tell you something.

6
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,759
Your favorite son,

7
00:02:49,039 --> 00:02:49,960
Cheng Feng...

8
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:53,360
His death wasn't an accident.

9
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,159
What are you

10
00:02:59,479 --> 00:03:00,919
trying to say?

11
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:17,159
I went to that company the other day

12
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,000
to check out that wine.

13
00:03:18,919 --> 00:03:19,759
And it turns out...

14
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,240
it's exactly like the wine we made before.

15
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:21,960
What wine?

16
00:03:22,039 --> 00:03:23,000
It has the exact same taste.

17
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,199
Exactly.

18
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,560
But our wine still tastes better.

19
00:03:27,879 --> 00:03:29,159
I think our wine tastes better too.

20
00:03:31,159 --> 00:03:32,439
You really are amazing.

21
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,120
You're pretty amazing yourself.

22
00:03:49,719 --> 00:03:50,520
What's wrong?

23
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:54,759
Brother Feng!

24
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:57,840
Brother Feng!

25
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,439
Brother Feng!

26
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:16,879
Brother Feng

27
00:04:17,759 --> 00:04:18,319
Brother Feng

28
00:04:18,319 --> 00:04:19,319
Let me explain, Brother Feng.

29
00:04:20,439 --> 00:04:21,720
Brother Feng, let me explain.

30
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:22,639
Brother Feng

31
00:04:23,399 --> 00:04:24,680
Brother Feng, let me explain.

32
00:04:27,319 --> 00:04:28,000
Brother Feng

33
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,360
Brother Feng

34
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,240
Brother Feng

35
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,160
Brother Feng, what's wrong?

36
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:32,879
Brother Feng

37
00:04:36,399 --> 00:04:37,040
Someone's here.

38
00:04:52,399 --> 00:04:53,240
Brother Feng

39
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,480
Don't blame me.

40
00:04:57,319 --> 00:04:58,600
I didn't have my phone.

41
00:05:00,759 --> 00:05:02,240
I couldn't call for an ambulance.

42
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:12,800
So I just watched helplessly

43
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:16,319
as he died right in front of me.

44
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:19,120
I heard that having a heart attack

45
00:05:19,759 --> 00:05:20,920
is very painful.

46
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:23,279
When Brother Feng finally died,

47
00:05:24,079 --> 00:05:25,959
he sure suffered a lot.

48
00:05:27,279 --> 00:05:29,319
Feng loved you so much.

49
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:34,079
How could you?

50
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,639
How could you?

51
00:05:38,879 --> 00:05:40,279
For you,

52
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:42,279
he defied me.

53
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:45,199
He protected you at every turn.

54
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,600
Loved me?

55
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:50,439
If he loved me, why draft a prenuptial agreement?

56
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:53,240
He knew full well I was Cheng An's girlfriend,

57
00:05:53,439 --> 00:05:54,199
yet he still came after me.

58
00:05:54,199 --> 00:05:55,680
He was no saint either.

59
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,600
Everyone in the Cheng family is the same.

60
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:06,560
You all

61
00:06:06,759 --> 00:06:07,439
deserve

62
00:06:07,439 --> 00:06:08,519
to die!

63
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,879
Get out!

64
00:06:42,319 --> 00:06:43,240
I never thought

65
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,680
I'd ever see you

66
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:47,600
looking so peaceful.

67
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:51,199
You were proud your whole life,

68
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:54,160
holding onto your precious dignity,

69
00:06:55,079 --> 00:06:56,519
looking down on everyone.

70
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,279
But now,

71
00:06:59,319 --> 00:07:00,959
you're just lying here.

72
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:03,800
Anyone

73
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:05,079
can do whatever they please

74
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,879
with you.

75
00:07:08,439 --> 00:07:09,240
Tell me,

76
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,759
what was it all for?

77
00:07:17,519 --> 00:07:18,319
I'll leave this

78
00:07:19,839 --> 00:07:21,560
as a memento for you.

79
00:07:25,959 --> 00:07:27,000
Next up,

80
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:32,800
there's quite a show waiting.

81
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,800
You aren't part of the Cheng family.

82
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,879
You have no right to be here.

83
00:07:57,879 --> 00:08:00,040
Grandma also kicked you out of the Cheng family before she died.

84
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,199
Aunt Lin is here too, isn't she?

85
00:08:03,199 --> 00:08:05,040
I hope Aunt Lin shows Grandma some respect.

86
00:08:06,079 --> 00:08:07,519
Don't cause trouble today.

87
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:09,079
It's okay, Dongdong.

88
00:08:13,639 --> 00:08:15,680
Do you think Grandma is lonely?

89
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:19,519
She loved having people around so much.

90
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,279
She definitely wouldn't want

91
00:08:21,279 --> 00:08:23,160
to leave so quietly.

92
00:08:24,879 --> 00:08:26,879
But everyone in this family...

93
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:29,439
No one cares about the dead.

94
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,800
Or rather,

95
00:08:33,919 --> 00:08:35,080
the people of the Cheng family...

96
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:38,080
They don't care about anyone at all.

97
00:08:39,879 --> 00:08:41,000
As your grandchild,

98
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:43,399
I'm here to say goodbye.

99
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,039
Mom!

100
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,080
Mom!

101
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:38,080
Your unfilial daughter is here, Mom.

102
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:40,279
How could you be so cruel?

103
00:09:41,759 --> 00:09:44,320
Not even letting me see you one last time.

104
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,960
Mom was perfectly fine when I left.

105
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:52,320
You must have killed her.

106
00:09:52,399 --> 00:09:53,279
Lin Wanmei!

107
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,440
I'll kill you!

108
00:09:54,919 --> 00:09:56,279
After so long in the sanatorium,

109
00:09:56,519 --> 00:09:57,360
how are you still like this?

110
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:02,279
Open your eyes and look closely.

111
00:10:02,759 --> 00:10:04,639
He's the one who killed your Mom.

112
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,159
Lin Wanmei!

113
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,480
Before Old Mrs. Cheng died,

114
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:14,039
the last person she saw was you.

115
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:16,080
If we're talking about murder,

116
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,919
you're the biggest suspect.

117
00:10:18,639 --> 00:10:21,399
It's precisely because I was with her at the end

118
00:10:22,639 --> 00:10:25,120
that she told me the whole truth.

119
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,200
Cheng An

120
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:29,720
isn't a member of the Cheng family at all.

121
00:10:30,639 --> 00:10:32,879
He's the son of the Old Master's first love,

122
00:10:32,879 --> 00:10:34,279
An Yue.

123
00:10:35,519 --> 00:10:37,320
Back then, An Yue died in a car crash,

124
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:40,039
and the Old Master brought Cheng An back to the Cheng family,

125
00:10:40,039 --> 00:10:41,679
raising him as his own son.

126
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,600
But instead of being grateful,

127
00:10:44,639 --> 00:10:47,679
he blamed the Cheng family for An Yue's death.

128
00:10:48,799 --> 00:10:50,279
To get back at the Cheng family,

129
00:10:51,519 --> 00:10:55,000
he manipulated you and Cheng Yan out step by step.

130
00:10:55,639 --> 00:10:56,879
The Old Madam

131
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:59,919
was angered to death by him too.

132
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:02,279
Old Mrs. Cheng is already gone,

133
00:11:02,679 --> 00:11:05,240
yet you're still here twisting the truth.

134
00:11:06,039 --> 00:11:06,919
Lin Wanmei,

135
00:11:07,519 --> 00:11:09,279
you're truly rotten to the core.

136
00:11:11,759 --> 00:11:13,879
On her deathbed, the Old Madam specifically told me

137
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,519
that I must protect Gufeng Group,

138
00:11:15,519 --> 00:11:16,720
and protect the Cheng family.

139
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:19,600
Don't let Cheng An take advantage again.

140
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,000
These were her dying words.

141
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:22,519
I,

142
00:11:23,039 --> 00:11:24,519
Fang Liangxi,

143
00:11:26,039 --> 00:11:27,399
state that it is now

144
00:11:27,639 --> 00:11:29,000
2025,

145
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:30,720
May 13th,

146
00:11:31,879 --> 00:11:34,200
14:28.

147
00:11:34,679 --> 00:11:36,600
I am of sound mind

148
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:38,039
and under no duress.

149
00:11:38,279 --> 00:11:40,279
I hereby make this will.

150
00:11:40,799 --> 00:11:41,879
After my death,

151
00:11:42,159 --> 00:11:43,879
all my assets,

152
00:11:44,399 --> 00:11:45,240
including

153
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:47,039
the shares in Gufeng Group,

154
00:11:47,519 --> 00:11:50,000
will go to my eldest daughter-in-law,

155
00:11:50,399 --> 00:11:51,480
Lin Wanmei.

156
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:53,440
Impossible!

157
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:55,399
How could she possibly give the shares

158
00:11:55,399 --> 00:11:56,679
to a bitch like you?

159
00:12:01,919 --> 00:12:03,480
I came back this time

160
00:12:04,039 --> 00:12:06,279
just to burn some incense for Mom.

161
00:12:08,279 --> 00:12:09,679
How she wrote her will,

162
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:11,559
and who she wanted to leave her inheritance to,

163
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,480
is entirely up to her.

164
00:12:16,679 --> 00:12:17,799
I respect her decisions.

165
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:22,799
You...

166
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,679
You're so useless!

167
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:27,480
The Cheng family belongs to us siblings.

168
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:29,200
Cheng An is a bastard.

169
00:12:29,559 --> 00:12:30,840
Ye Xiaowei is a fraud.

170
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:31,600
Enough.

171
00:12:36,919 --> 00:12:39,519
Since no one has any objections to the will...

172
00:12:39,519 --> 00:12:40,320
Wait a minute.

173
00:12:41,519 --> 00:12:43,879
I have a different will here.

174
00:12:46,759 --> 00:12:47,879
How is that possible?

175
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:53,840
According to the contents of the will,

176
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:57,600
Old Mrs. Cheng left all the shares under her name

177
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:59,240
to her son,

178
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:01,039
Cheng Yan.

179
00:13:03,399 --> 00:13:05,200
The remainder will be put into a trust fund

180
00:13:05,879 --> 00:13:07,919
for Dongdong's daily life

181
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:09,799
and medical expenses.

182
00:13:13,879 --> 00:13:14,679
Mom!

183
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,919
Mom, you still cared about me.

184
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:18,000
Mom!

185
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,000
Dongdong,

186
00:13:20,879 --> 00:13:22,480
Mom still loves us.

187
00:13:22,519 --> 00:13:24,159
She left something for you.

188
00:13:24,159 --> 00:13:25,720
We are still in her heart.

189
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:26,440
Dongdong.

190
00:13:26,559 --> 00:13:27,320
Impossible.

191
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:30,600
The Old Madam recorded that video right before she died.

192
00:13:30,919 --> 00:13:32,799
She couldn't have had time to change her will.

193
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:34,679
That copy in your hands is fake!

194
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:37,159
This will is notarized.

195
00:13:37,879 --> 00:13:39,440
Legally speaking,

196
00:13:39,799 --> 00:13:41,320
it takes precedence over your video.

197
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:51,879
I thought you'd hate me.

198
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:54,679
Why make me the notary for this will?

199
00:13:58,559 --> 00:14:00,799
I really don't like Ye Xiaowei.

200
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:02,879
But

201
00:14:03,799 --> 00:14:05,600
I still treated Sang Luo

202
00:14:06,279 --> 00:14:09,120
as my very own granddaughter.

203
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:12,519
In my life,

204
00:14:13,039 --> 00:14:15,120
I've made many mistakes.

205
00:14:15,799 --> 00:14:17,399
The ones I've wronged the most

206
00:14:17,799 --> 00:14:21,279
are probably Feng and his daughter.

207
00:14:23,159 --> 00:14:24,480
Ye Xiaowei,

208
00:14:27,679 --> 00:14:28,759
thank you

209
00:14:31,279 --> 00:14:33,399
for letting me live out

210
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:36,240
my dream of having a granddaughter.

211
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:39,000
Lin Wanmei.

212
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:42,639
Old Mrs. Cheng left you nothing.

213
00:14:43,559 --> 00:14:44,759
You schemed against me!

214
00:14:48,919 --> 00:14:50,200
Fang Liangxi!

215
00:14:52,639 --> 00:14:53,440
Even in death,

216
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,720
you still had to play me!

217
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:25,799
This day comes for everyone.

218
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:28,639
Try not to be too sad.

219
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:32,519
It's not that I'm sad.

220
00:15:36,039 --> 00:15:37,360
It's just that my heart feels heavy.

221
00:15:49,159 --> 00:15:50,639
Sometimes,

222
00:15:51,279 --> 00:15:53,080
when you've bottled up too much,

223
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:56,360
it helps to get drunk and let it out.

224
00:16:01,360 --> 00:16:02,720
You're not going to tell me to drink less?

225
00:16:03,559 --> 00:16:04,639
I'll get drunk with you.

226
00:16:09,519 --> 00:16:10,039
Cheers.

227
00:16:23,519 --> 00:16:24,600
Originally,

228
00:16:25,120 --> 00:16:26,440
I wanted to fulfill my role as a son

229
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:27,639
and see her off one last time.

230
00:16:28,039 --> 00:16:29,360
But I never expected

231
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:31,200
that right before her death,

232
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:34,600
she would still try to destroy me.

233
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:37,080
For those who have faced life and death,

234
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:39,919
even with just a single breath left,

235
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:43,759
no one can change our destiny.

236
00:17:01,159 --> 00:17:02,440
Big Sister was right.

237
00:17:02,919 --> 00:17:05,519
I am just a child who never cut the cord.

238
00:17:06,799 --> 00:17:07,759
If I couldn't get fed,

239
00:17:07,759 --> 00:17:08,680
I'd cry.

240
00:17:09,559 --> 00:17:10,319
If I couldn't get my way,

241
00:17:10,319 --> 00:17:11,200
I'd throw a tantrum.

242
00:17:13,559 --> 00:17:14,839
Because all along,

243
00:17:16,759 --> 00:17:19,839
you and Big Brother have always protected me.

244
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,559
It wasn't until I went to the UK

245
00:17:27,640 --> 00:17:29,880
that I slowly learned to take care of myself.

246
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:32,920
You sending me to the UK

247
00:17:32,920 --> 00:17:34,720
was to cut my cord.

248
00:17:44,279 --> 00:17:45,079
Mom,

249
00:17:45,799 --> 00:17:46,960
I promise you,

250
00:17:50,759 --> 00:17:51,559
from now on...

251
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:55,519
from now on, I will act like an adult.

252
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:58,279
Standing tall...

253
00:17:58,359 --> 00:17:59,759
all by myself...

254
00:18:00,519 --> 00:18:03,000
I'll stand tall on my own

255
00:18:03,599 --> 00:18:04,640
and move forward.

256
00:18:09,039 --> 00:18:11,079
A grown man, crying like a baby.

257
00:18:12,319 --> 00:18:13,160
What do you want?

258
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:15,720
Didn't I tell you to come later?

259
00:18:15,839 --> 00:18:17,359
Why are you here so early?

260
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:18,799
Didn't you need to see me?

261
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:19,759
Spit it out.

262
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:21,880
Why so aggressive?

263
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:23,200
Wanna hit me?

264
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:24,559
Well, every time I hit you,

265
00:18:24,559 --> 00:18:26,039
wasn't it you who provoked me first?

266
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:26,880
I...

267
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:34,440
After fighting with you for so long,

268
00:18:34,839 --> 00:18:35,279
even if you aren't tired,

269
00:18:35,279 --> 00:18:36,400
I am.

270
00:18:47,839 --> 00:18:48,640
What do you mean?

271
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:51,240
What's wrong?

272
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:52,759
Getting cold feet?

273
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:54,000
Afraid to take it?

274
00:19:00,279 --> 00:19:01,440
No reward without merit.

275
00:19:06,119 --> 00:19:07,799
I didn't say it was a gift.

276
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:10,960
Whatever the original price,

277
00:19:11,319 --> 00:19:12,599
I'll sell it to you

278
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,240
at market price.

279
00:19:16,119 --> 00:19:17,119
Business

280
00:19:17,319 --> 00:19:18,200
is business.

281
00:19:18,799 --> 00:19:20,640
Besides, we aren't even real brothers.

282
00:19:23,920 --> 00:19:24,720
Cheng An,

283
00:19:26,079 --> 00:19:27,039
after all these years,

284
00:19:27,440 --> 00:19:29,880
I've never treated you as part of the Cheng family.

285
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:32,079
But I have to admit,

286
00:19:32,759 --> 00:19:33,799
your capabilities

287
00:19:34,559 --> 00:19:35,640
are indeed

288
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:38,880
slightly better than mine.

289
00:19:42,559 --> 00:19:44,039
Gufeng Group is what the old man

290
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:46,440
and Mom

291
00:19:47,759 --> 00:19:49,759
built from scratch with their blood and sweat.

292
00:19:53,759 --> 00:19:55,599
I can't let it be ruined in my hands.

293
00:19:57,599 --> 00:19:58,400
So,

294
00:20:02,079 --> 00:20:03,640
I have no choice but to hand Gufeng Group

295
00:20:05,160 --> 00:20:06,359
over to an outsider.

296
00:20:14,200 --> 00:20:15,000
Thank you.

297
00:20:18,599 --> 00:20:19,880
I'm finally free!

298
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:24,680
What are you going to do next?

299
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:26,920
Don't worry about me.

300
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:30,680
If you have a conscience,

301
00:20:31,799 --> 00:20:33,400
just give me some dividends every year.

302
00:20:37,759 --> 00:20:38,720
Don't let your Second Brother

303
00:20:40,079 --> 00:20:41,000
starve to death.

304
00:20:47,359 --> 00:20:48,160
I'm leaving.

305
00:20:48,680 --> 00:20:49,480
Second Brother!

306
00:20:58,799 --> 00:21:00,640
Remember to wash the handkerchief and return it to me.

307
00:21:24,839 --> 00:21:25,640
Dongdong

308
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:27,279
Why are you here?

309
00:21:27,640 --> 00:21:28,519
I'm here too.

310
00:21:28,640 --> 00:21:29,599
You little brat.

311
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:32,400
Mom.

312
00:21:32,839 --> 00:21:34,720
We agreed to come say goodbye to Sister Xiaowei.

313
00:21:35,079 --> 00:21:36,119
There you go again.

314
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:38,000
Couldn't you just tell her over the phone?

315
00:21:38,079 --> 00:21:39,640
You had to make someone with bad legs

316
00:21:39,799 --> 00:21:41,480
come see someone with perfectly good ones.

317
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:43,559
I'll let you two talk.

318
00:21:43,559 --> 00:21:44,720
I'll wait for you in the car.

319
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:45,880
Don't miss your flight.

320
00:21:51,079 --> 00:21:51,880
Sister Xiaowei,

321
00:21:52,319 --> 00:21:53,240
I've decided

322
00:21:53,480 --> 00:21:55,319
to go to France to treat my legs.

323
00:21:55,640 --> 00:21:57,640
There's a hot spring therapy center there

324
00:21:58,079 --> 00:21:59,640
that's perfect for post-op rehab.

325
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:02,000
My mom decided to go with me.

326
00:22:02,319 --> 00:22:03,160
So today,

327
00:22:03,599 --> 00:22:04,839
I'm here to say goodbye to you.

328
00:22:06,720 --> 00:22:07,519
That's great.

329
00:22:08,519 --> 00:22:10,160
Does that mean the next time I see you,

330
00:22:10,319 --> 00:22:12,240
you'll be running and jumping again?

331
00:22:14,599 --> 00:22:15,200
Come on.

332
00:22:15,200 --> 00:22:15,759
Come inside and sit down.

333
00:22:15,759 --> 00:22:16,519
No thanks, Sister Xiaowei.

334
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:18,440
I'm rushing to catch a flight.

335
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:20,240
Hold on a second.

336
00:22:29,799 --> 00:22:30,400
Here.

337
00:22:31,799 --> 00:22:32,599
This is...

338
00:22:32,640 --> 00:22:34,680
This is an exclusive red wine I made just for you.

339
00:22:35,119 --> 00:22:37,519
You're finally old enough to drink wine.

340
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:39,240
Why don't you give it a name?

341
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:42,000
Red wine...

342
00:22:42,759 --> 00:22:44,079
It's a cozy,

343
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:45,279
warm,

344
00:22:46,039 --> 00:22:47,279
and lively kind of drink.

345
00:22:48,079 --> 00:22:50,640
Just like when we used to sit around the table,

346
00:22:51,480 --> 00:22:52,880
talking and laughing together.

347
00:22:53,559 --> 00:22:54,680
Why don't we call it

348
00:22:58,319 --> 00:22:59,119
Home.

349
00:23:04,440 --> 00:23:05,240
Home.

350
00:23:24,640 --> 00:23:25,720
You're back.

351
00:23:29,079 --> 00:23:30,640
What's that in your hand?

352
00:23:31,920 --> 00:23:32,720
Nothing.

353
00:23:33,079 --> 00:23:34,160
Could it be...

354
00:23:34,160 --> 00:23:35,799
those old men at Gufeng Group

355
00:23:35,839 --> 00:23:37,079
finally figured it out

356
00:23:37,279 --> 00:23:39,359
and had you bring the shares back to me?

357
00:23:40,559 --> 00:23:41,359
Wanmei.

358
00:23:41,759 --> 00:23:42,559
You're drunk.

359
00:23:43,279 --> 00:23:44,559
Just get some good sleep.

360
00:23:44,640 --> 00:23:46,200
How could I possibly sleep?

361
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:49,359
The Wine Competition is in a few days.

362
00:23:49,720 --> 00:23:51,480
I still haven't picked my wine.

363
00:23:53,200 --> 00:23:55,000
I have to beat Ye Xiaowei.

364
00:23:55,759 --> 00:23:56,880
I can't lose.

365
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:58,720
I can't lose.

366
00:23:59,400 --> 00:24:00,200
I know.

367
00:24:01,000 --> 00:24:02,279
But you need a good rest

368
00:24:02,279 --> 00:24:03,559
to have the energy to compete.

369
00:24:04,039 --> 00:24:04,720
Right?

370
00:24:06,640 --> 00:24:07,440
Be good.

371
00:24:11,680 --> 00:24:13,160
I'm going to win, right?

372
00:24:13,160 --> 00:24:13,880
Yes.

373
00:24:15,200 --> 00:24:16,000
Get some sleep.

374
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:16,640
Come here.

375
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:20,200
I'm the real champion.

376
00:24:21,519 --> 00:24:22,480
You're the champion.

377
00:24:28,759 --> 00:24:29,720
I'm the champion.

378
00:24:29,960 --> 00:24:31,039
Just sleep for a bit.

379
00:24:32,240 --> 00:24:33,039
Be good.

380
00:24:47,039 --> 00:24:48,440
In my heart, you've

381
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:51,039
always been a champion.
